 font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_a8 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_a8 p {  margin-top: 8.00pt;  margin-bottom: 8.00pt;  text-align: center;  line-height: 1.50;}span.docx_a8 {  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}p.docx_a9 {  margin-left: 36.00pt;  line-height: 1.50;}p.docx_a9 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_aa {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;}p.docx_ab {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;  line-height: 1.50;}p.docx_ab span {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}p.docx_ab span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_ac {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_ac p {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;  line-height: 1.50;}span.docx_ac {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}span.docx_ad {  font-weight: bold;  text-transform: lowercase;  color: #0F4761;}p.docx_ae {  line-height: 1.00;  text-align: center;}p.docx_ae span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_ae span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af p {  line-height: 1.00;  text-align: center;}span.docx_af {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_af0 {  line-height: 1.00;}p.docx_af0 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_af0 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af1 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af1 p {  line-height: 1.00;}span.docx_af1 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2026年西电“TI”杯电赛校赛及测评顺利举办</span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;">（通讯员：李雨涵）2026年西安电子科技大学"TI杯"模拟电子线路设计竞赛暨电子设计竞赛校赛于2026年4月30日至5月5日在南校区成功举办。本次赛事由创新创业学院、电工电子国家级示范中心、电子设计竞赛实训基地联合主办，并得到德州仪器（TI）半导体技术（上海）有限公司、普源精电科技股份有限公司、陕西省电源学会及西安无线电通信学会的大力支持。</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;">竞赛吸引了全校11个学院的195支参赛队伍，设置了A题-波形发生与合成电路系统、B题-三相交错并联同步降压变换器智能控制装置、C题-多功能小车、D题-简易电路特性测试仪和E题-基于单目视觉的目标物测量装置五个赛道。经过为四天的激烈角逐，多数参赛队伍都成功完成了作品设计与制作。</p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/B/48/AB/29E888648A6146A201164ABEDE9_A0E18BBB_1C155.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/B48AB29E888648A6146A201164ABEDE9/A0E18BBB/1C155" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/C/AA/40/BCDAA81552378D7C66E9D120326_696132B8_3CBFF.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;">图1 实验室参赛现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;">5月5日上午8时，测评阶段正式开启。测评专家与助理教练密切配合，历经一整天的紧张工作，所有参赛作品均顺利完成测评，为本次校赛画上了圆满的句号。</p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/2/B6/54/3900559C6BDE8F8154D17E3C6E6_E962FDC7_1CBF1.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/2B6543900559C6BDE8F8154D17E3C6E6/E962FDC7/1CBF1" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/1/7E/07/E583A70A7361E33220F6EAB92E9_0513287E_40863.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;">图2 测评工作会议现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;">会议开始阶段，校聘电子设计竞赛教练组组长王新怀教授率先就本次校赛的测评工作流程和评分规范作了详细说明，并就各测评小组的人员分工与任务安排组织开展了讨论。此后，各赛题命题专家依次对各赛题的测评要点、评分标准及关键扣分项进行了简要讲解。会议结束后，各测评小组按既定安排分赴各测评场地，严格依据评审标准对参赛作品展开验收测评。</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 205.8pt; height: 268.25pt;"><img src="/__local/D/63/F1/ABAD9036EFD959677FC1814CB14_0ECF17DC_16A6D.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/D63F1ABAD9036EFD959677FC1814CB14/0ECF17DC/16A6D" vheight=" 268.38pt" vwidth=" 205.9pt" orisrc="/__local/8/A0/4B/42EE49670E6B2DE6D9EC9A66672_E5613263_3282B.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 205.9pt; height: 268.38pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图3 A题测评现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/F/68/0A/47B4C05F76C321FB2F660659575_3AD58FE0_2707B.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F680A47B4C05F76C321FB2F660659575/3AD58FE0/2707B" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/C/3C/55/6C11398B5C2FC78485E4FAAD730_5696B047_5521A.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图4 B题测评现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/0/75/EE/85048CD697F137127FB60587543_4A8CF7BB_2DC88.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/075EE85048CD697F137127FB60587543/4A8CF7BB/2DC88" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/B/4C/6C/986CBDCC3180D47C7310B111043_F75624F3_61F6C.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图5 C题测评现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/C/AC/19/25E933625F3BAA2CE0F4CFEFDDD_A04E63BC_22D42.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CAC1925E933625F3BAA2CE0F4CFEFDDD/A04E63BC/22D42" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/6/BE/B7/A7E0E896E8D6D90F2477E4FF274_EE46E73F_4B5C3.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图6 D题测评现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/8/96/8E/1EF619A3A73520812D359F900FA_832C8089_21014.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/8968E1EF619A3A73520812D359F900FA/832C8089/21014" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/A/E2/A6/5BFED4EA3C94AD191EB6EC193AC_A05EB936_4888A.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图7 E题测评现场</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"><img src="/__local/4/05/BF/AA52728EC57E0AC00A7040E682E_2C3BD738_22072.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/405BFAA52728EC57E0AC00A7040E682E/2C3BD738/22072" vheight=" 255.12pt" vwidth=" 340.13pt" orisrc="/__local/6/37/4F/B0383F7840BB93B566E432E0586_AF9A5A63_4B2BA.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 340.13pt; height: 255.12pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: center;">图8 优秀作品展示</p><p style="text-indent: 24pt; text-align: justify;">全国大学生电子设计竞赛是由教育部与工业和信息化部联合主办的面向大学生的学科竞赛活动。本次校内选拔赛采用自主命题形式，要求参赛队伍独立完成赛题设计，并全程模拟正式竞赛的评审流程。通过这一赛事平台，学生的工程实践能力与团队协作水平得到了有效锻炼，同时也为备战2026年全国大学生电子设计竞赛陕西赛区TI杯赛事积累了宝贵的实战经验，为后续参赛奠定了扎实基础。</p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
